WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.419
Welcome to the Atmospheric Lighting class

2
00:00:03.419 --> 00:00:06.059
for Unreal Engine 5.6.

3
00:00:06.059 --> 00:00:08.099
In this class, we'll explore the fundamentals

4
00:00:08.099 --> 00:00:11.660
of working with and manipulating volumetric fog.

5
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.900
We'll also cover how to utilize God rays, fog cards,

6
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.899
and implement localized fog volumes

7
00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:19.210
to add depth to your level.

8
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.789
We'll briefly cover the basics of using a post-processing

9
00:00:21.789 --> 00:00:25.530
volume, as well as create a basic post-processing material

10
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.410
that can be added to a post-processing volume

11
00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.140
or further artistic effect and control.

12
00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.659
Finally, we'll wrap up the class

13
00:00:32.659 --> 00:00:36.060
with a few hands-on examples of lighting an interior scene,

14
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.140
as well as briefly covering some concepts

15
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.740
when using megalights.

16
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.579
Let's get started.
